   "NICE NG136: for people of Black African or African-Caribbean family origin without diabetes, start a calcium-channel blocker.",
   ["", "ACE inhibitors are less effective as first-line in this group without diabetes.", "Not first line.", "Not first line.", "Not the rule."],
